# ─── LOGIN MODULE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

TEST L-01: Wrong password shows error message

STEPS
  navigate to "/#/login"
  type "admin@test.com" into "Email address"
  type "wrongpassword" into "Password"
  click "Sign In"

ASSERT
  error shows "Invalid email or password"

---

TEST L-02: Valid credentials navigate to the budgets page

STEPS
  navigate to "/#/login"
  type "admin@test.com" into "Email address"
  type "test123" into "Password"
  click "Sign In"

ASSERT
  url contains "#/budgets"
  "FY 2024 Budget" is visible
